se ATK and ER. Excellent accessible support choice."},{"name":"Blackcliff Longsword","text":"565 Base ATK; CRIT DMG suits personal damage more than support."},{"name":"Fleuve Cendre Ferryman","text":"Free ER option; lower Base ATK and little team-buff benefit."}],"a":[{"names":["Noblesse Oblige"],"text":"20% team ATK after Burst; his best general support set.","stats":"ER · HP% · Healing Bonus or HP%"},{"names":["Emblem of Severed Fate"],"text":"ER and personal Burst DMG; use when Noblesse is covered.","stats":"ER/ATK% · Pyro DMG · CR/CD"},{"names":["Scroll of the Hero of Cinder City"],"text":"Minor elemental buff without Nightsoul; generally weaker than Noblesse.","stats":"ATK%/ER · Pyro DMG · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Phoenix Dive","members":["Bennett","Gaming","Furina","Xianyun"],"text":"Gaming delivers powerful Pyro plunging attacks, supported by Bennett's ATK buff, Furina's damage bonus, and Xianyun's plunging support and healing.","roles":["ATK Buff","Main DPS","Hydro / DMG Buff","Healer / VV"]},{"name":"Raiden Hypercarry","members":["Bennett","Raiden Shogun","Kujou Sara","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Raiden Shogun deals on-field Electro damage while Sara and Bennett provide ATK buffs.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","Main DPS","Buffer","Support"]},{"name":"Crimson Reign","members":["Bennett","Arlecchino","Kaedehara Kazuha","Yelan"],"text":"Bennett boosts Arlecchino's ATK while Yelan provides off-field Hydro damage for Vaporize.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","On-field DPS","Buffer / Debuffer","Off-field DPS / Buffer"]},{"name":"Crimson Tide","members":["Bennett","Tartaglia","Xiangling","Kaedehara Kazuha"],"text":"Tartaglia enables powerful Vaporize reactions with Xiangling's Pyronado.","roles":["Healer / Buffer","Hydro Driver","Off-Field DPS","Anemo Buffer"]}],"v":"Standard Burst Buffer: Use for his strongest general team ATK buffs and reliable healing.\nF2P Battery Support: Choose Sapwood for stronger base-ATK buffs or Favonius when team energy matters more.\nPersonal P